<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Can you give a hand a shake, hand a shake, hand a shake?</l><l>Can you give a hand a shake, hand a shake?</l><l>We can smile and give a shake, a new friend then we will make,</l><l>We can give a hand a shake, hand a shake.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Can you look ’em in the eye, in the eye, in the eye?</l><l>Can you look ’em in the eye, in the eye?</l><l>We can look ’em in the eye, not the floor and not the sky!</l><l>We can look ’em in the eye, in the eye.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Can you greet with, “Buenos dias, buenos dias, buenos dias”,</l><l>Can you greet with “Buenos dias, buenos dias.”</l><l>We can greet with “Buenos dias, we’re so glad you came to see us!”</l><l>We can greet with “Buenos dias, buenos dias.”</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Can you bow bending low and say, “Ahn nyeong hasayo?”</l><l>Can you bow low and say, “Ahn nyeong hasayo?”</l><l>We can bow bending low and say, “Ahn nyeong hasayo!”</l><l>To Koreans we say, “Ahn nyeong hasayo.”</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Can you nod and say, “Nee how,” say, “Nee how,“say, “Nee how,”</l><l>Can you nod and say, “Nee how,” say, “Nee how.”</l><l>We can nod and say, “Nee how;” They’ll say, “You know Chinese, WOW!”</l><l>We can nod and say, “Nee how,” say, “Nee how.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
